{"ticker":"ELV","updated":"2026-10-23T22:55:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Elevance Health, Inc.","shortName":"Elevance Health, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Healthcare Plans","country":"United States","website":"https://www.elevancehealth.com","fullTimeEmployees":96129,"marketCap":95411650560,"trailingPE":18.68153,"forwardPE":14.556978,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.47272804,"pegRatio":1.46,"targetMeanPrice":481.4762,"targetHighPrice":523.0,"targetLowPrice":406.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.014,"earningsGrowth":0.179,"grossMargins":0.26432,"operatingMargins":0.041840002,"profitMargins":0.02546,"totalRevenue":201832005632,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":450.69,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":274.84,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.55},"summary":"Elevance Health, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a health benefits company in the United States. The company operates in four segments: Health Benefits, CarelonRx, Carelon Services, and Corporate & Other. It offers a variety of health plans and services to individual, employer group risk-based and fee-based, BlueCard, Medicare, Medicaid, and FEP members; health products; a broad array of fee-based administrative managed care services; and specialty and other insurance products and services, such as stop loss, dental, vision, and supplemental health insurance benefits. The company also operates in the pharmacy services business; and markets and offers pharmacy services, including home delivery and specialty pharmacies, claims adjudication, formulary management, pharmacy networks, rebate administration, a prescription drug database, and member services, as well as infusion services and injectable therapies through ambulatory infusion centers. In addition, it provides healthcare related services and capabilities, including specialty care enablement and utilization management support for specialized clinical domains; behavioral health and comprehensive care management services; palliative care services and management; virtual care; and payment integrity, subrogation, clinical data exchange through its HealthOS platform, research and data, reporting and clinical an","summary_zh":"Elevance Health, Inc. 及其子公司在美國作為一家健康福利公司運作。該公司分為四個業務部門：健康福利部門、CarelonRx 部門、Carelon 服務部門以及企業及其他部門。它為個人、雇主團體基於風險和收費的 BlueCard、Medicare、Medicaid 和 FEP 會員提供各種健康計劃和服務；保健品；一系列收費的行政管理式醫療服務；專業保險和其他保險產品和服務，例如止損、牙科、視力和補充健康保險福利。該公司還經營藥房服務業務；行銷和提供藥房服務，包括送貨上門和專業藥房、索賠裁決、處方管理、藥房網路、回扣管理、處方藥資料庫和會員服務，以及透過流動輸液中心提供的輸液服務和注射療法。此外，它還提供醫療保健相關服務和功能，包括針對專業臨床領域的專業護理支援和利用管理支援；行為健康和綜合護理管理服務；安寧療護服務和管理；虛擬護理；支付完整性、代位權、透過其 HealthOS 平台進行臨床數據交換、研究和數據、報告和臨床","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療保健計劃","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":316.31,"h":317.06,"l":312.63,"c":314.0,"v":1239000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":312.43,"h":313.84,"l":307.6,"c":310.03,"v":1843700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":309.48,"h":312.52,"l":306.85,"c":309.81,"v":1462900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":311.15,"h":311.18,"l":305.34,"c":310.41,"v":1193700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":310.74,"h":320.1,"l":310.45,"c":318.65,"v":3115300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":319.49,"h":325.65,"l":317.75,"c":322.33,"v":1950100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":319.66,"h":323.96,"l":317.46,"c":321.59,"v":1645600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":308.6,"h":313.85,"l":306.38,"c":308.05,"v":2826900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":308.5,"h":315.27,"l":304.16,"c":313.64,"v":1862300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":315.62,"h":318.13,"l":306.7,"c":308.16,"v":2006100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":310.55,"h":316.88,"l":309.3,"c":315.09,"v":1926800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":310.22,"h":312.81,"l":304.63,"c":306.75,"v":1723600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":314.01,"h":317.6,"l":311.14,"c":314.89,"v":3594500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":317.42,"h":319.24,"l":311.34,"c":311.76,"v":1503300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":311.8,"h":313.46,"l":306.0,"c":306.91,"v":2001800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":307.69,"h":311.33,"l":304.33,"c":310.0,"v":2068100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":311.5,"h":315.79,"l":307.18,"c":308.48,"v":1621200},{"t":"